  "details": "I would say: watch the video, that will make it more clear.\n\nThis bug is kinda funny actually.\n\nBasically when going from a VRC UI Shape object to a screen-like-material (with a [bugged] VRC UI Shape) the cursor gets stuck in 3d.\n\nIt could possibly be just my world, but then still, this shouldnt happen in the first place.\n\nThere is a VRC UI Shape on the screen but it doesnt seem to be working maybe thats partially why this is happening, but still this shouldnt happen.\n\nI uploaded also a screenshot of the screen seen in the video. I also tested my other screens in the world which all have a different material and shader and they all have the same problem.",
